    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: a64eab8c2f07436b87ed7e1f132e1ec4
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A charger (rhino, battering beast, ram drone — any faction): from 5–25 m with the target in sight it paws the ground for a moment (the tell), then charges in a straight line it can''t turn from — hitting knocks the target flat, sidestepping it slams the charger into whatever is behind and stuns it. Closes to charging range facing its target; strikes in reach.'
        _children:
        - 385ea1a887484032bf12f709f98b13cd
